    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2265520/extras/fbd74a26dcf39600492446bb3eac2e35.poster.avif?t=1741193458\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2265520/extras/fbd74a26dcf39600492446bb3eac2e35.webm?t=1741193458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2265520/extras/fbd74a26dcf39600492446bb3eac2e35.mp4?t=1741193458\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay Objective:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get the Star safely to the Ground</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click on other Blocks to remove them or interact with them</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let Gravity and Physics do its work</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Success!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2265520/extras/474fa324f77270d06778373f875ba59e.poster.avif?t=1741193458\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2265520/extras/474fa324f77270d06778373f875ba59e.webm?t=1741193458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2265520/extras/474fa324f77270d06778373f875ba59e.mp4?t=1741193458\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Versus Mode</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get your Star to the Ground to score a point</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Knock your opponents Star off to also score a point</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obstruct your opponent by sending them your blocks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pure Chaos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First to 10 Points Wins!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2265520/extras/02aa53baeb1ffcd509555c3e06897960.poster.avif?t=1741193458\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2265520/extras/02aa53baeb1ffcd509555c3e06897960.webm?t=1741193458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2265520/extras/02aa53baeb1ffcd509555c3e06897960.mp4?t=1741193458\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Level Editor &amp; Online Levels:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple Level Sizes and Visual Styles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various fun Game Mechanics (Hazards, Bombs, Moving Platforms, Portals &amp; More)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make fun, creative and exciting levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upload and Share your level with others online</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play levels made by others!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2265520/extras/92d12e2d81a01693152edb21a0dab1a0.poster.avif?t=1741193458\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2265520/extras/92d12e2d81a01693152edb21a0dab1a0.webm?t=1741193458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2265520/extras/92d12e2d81a01693152edb21a0dab1a0.mp4?t=1741193458\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >150 Arcade Levels to Challenge your Wits across 5 Unique Worlds!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Versus Mode: Play against a Friend!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100 Extra Bonus Levels </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leaderboards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level Editor: Create and share your own unique levels with friends!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Block Database: Play more levels online from around the world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special unlocks: Achievements, Music &amp; Art</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cross Play &amp; Cloud Saves - Continue your game on any other device</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2265520/extras/fbd74a26dcf39600492446bb3eac2e35.poster.avif?t=1741193458\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2265520/extras/fbd74a26dcf39600492446bb3eac2e35.webm?t=1741193458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2265520/extras/fbd74a26dcf39600492446bb3eac2e35.mp4?t=1741193458\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay Objective:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get the Star safely to the Ground</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click on other Blocks to remove them or interact with them</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let Gravity and Physics do its work</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Success!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2265520/extras/474fa324f77270d06778373f875ba59e.poster.avif?t=1741193458\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2265520/extras/474fa324f77270d06778373f875ba59e.webm?t=1741193458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2265520/extras/474fa324f77270d06778373f875ba59e.mp4?t=1741193458\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Versus Mode</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get your Star to the Ground to score a point</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Knock your opponents Star off to also score a point</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obstruct your opponent by sending them your blocks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pure Chaos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First to 10 Points Wins!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2265520/extras/02aa53baeb1ffcd509555c3e06897960.poster.avif?t=1741193458\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2265520/extras/02aa53baeb1ffcd509555c3e06897960.webm?t=1741193458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2265520/extras/02aa53baeb1ffcd509555c3e06897960.mp4?t=1741193458\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Level Editor &amp; Online Levels:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple Level Sizes and Visual Styles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various fun Game Mechanics (Hazards, Bombs, Moving Platforms, Portals &amp; More)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make fun, creative and exciting levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upload and Share your level with others online</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play levels made by others!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2265520/extras/92d12e2d81a01693152edb21a0dab1a0.poster.avif?t=1741193458\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2265520/extras/92d12e2d81a01693152edb21a0dab1a0.webm?t=1741193458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2265520/extras/92d12e2d81a01693152edb21a0dab1a0.mp4?t=1741193458\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >150 Arcade Levels to Challenge your Wits across 5 Unique Worlds!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Versus Mode: Play against a Friend!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100 Extra Bonus Levels </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leaderboards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level Editor: Create and share your own unique levels with friends!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Block Database: Play more levels online from around the world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special unlocks: Achievements, Music &amp; Art</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cross Play &amp; Cloud Saves - Continue your game on any other device</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Drop It: Block Paradise is all about using various physic game mechanics, like gravity, bouncy blocks, bombs and more to safely get the Stars to the ground floor to solve Physics-based Puzzle levels. Featuring 250+ Puzzle Levels, Chaotic Versus Mode, Level Editor &amp; Online Levels await you!",
    "supported_languages": "English",
    "reviews": "\u201cI feel Block Paradise is a good afternoon of puzzling action regardless of where you play it\u201d<br>7 \u2013 Seafoam Gaming<br><br>\u201cDrop It: Block Paradise has some good ideas, clever design, many achievements to collect, and a fun level editor.\u201d<br>Positive \u2013 Ladies Gamers<br>",
